ind of see a little bit more up here in  the top left corner more portraits and  more of the same when it comes to the  penance when it comes to the house pride  the hogwarts banners the red and gold  all displayed here and then we get a  nice overhead shot here of the common  room one sort of final pan of most  everything that we have seen already  throughout this trailer another look at  the shuffling card deck but then  something new in this one over here on  the left we catch the brief glimpse of  the golden snitch just there on the left  side of the screen now unfortunately if  you guys didn't see already quidditch  has been confirmed to not be playable in  hogwarts legacy but this makes the  second time that we have seen a snitch  like this flying around i could  definitely see that tying into some sort  of minigame or some sort of collectible  where we have to find it throughout  hogwarts now as a gryffindor myself i  absolutely love the gryffindor common  room but there are some amazing features  over in the slytherin common room as  well you can check that video out on the  left side of your screen now we got  ravenclaw up next once i have that video  ready it will be on the right side of  your screen as always thank you all so  much for watching i'll talk to you again  soon
 

